diff --git a/.git_commit_msg b/.git_commit_msg
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..4cdce4e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.git_commit_msg
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+Add support for weekly subscriptions
+
+Weekly subscriptions charge every 7 days from their first charge (--since).
+Monthly cost is calculated as price × 52 ÷ 12, rounded to the nearest cent.
+
+- Add CYCLE.WEEK constant and update CLI to accept --every week/weekly
+- Calculate weekly monthly cost: price × 52 ÷ 12 cents
+- Update nextCharge to add 7 days for weekly cycles
+- Fix renewals sorting to order by date instead of label
+- Use monthlyCents function in export module for consistency
+- Add comprehensive tests for weekly functionality
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
